.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/splash

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Switch on or off the ascii logo on start up and when the /about command is called.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/splash on|off

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBon|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable splash logo.
.RE
